OL,3,GNEWSAMicrosoft says it is 'deeply
OL,4,Asorry' for global outage after almost
OL,5,A24 hours of disruption
OL,6,
OL,7,FAmong those affected have been
OL,8,Fgovernments, businesses and personal
OL,9,Fusers - the UK cyber minister says the
OL,10,Foutage has been "inconvenient and
OL,11,Fdisruptive" with "limited" reports of
OL,12,Fimpact on frontline service delivery
OL,14,FSouth African winemaker Peter Pentz
OL,15,Ftells us communication with exporters
OL,16,Fhas been brought "to a standstill".
OL,17,FMeanwhile, a group in London say they
OL,18,Fleft the office because if emails
OL,19,Fweren't working "it was time to go to
OL,20,Fthe pub"
